{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astrum Vanguard:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astrum Vanguard</strong> is a fast-paced top-down shooter in retro pixel style where you fight against hostile alien species. Pilot your ship through dense enemy swarms, dodge deadly projectiles, and destroy bizarre boss enemies with an arsenal of futuristic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Intense Combat in Stylish Pixel Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/extras/14e89aa02034a138c0f54877f8a23779.avif?t=1759155778\" width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Battle enemies in hand-drawn pixel graphics inspired by classic arcade shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e\u00a0<strong>Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/extras/2c854c674bf532f12f13729b34b900f8.avif?t=1759155778\" width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Face different alien enemy types, from insectoid creatures in the early stages to the futuristic Krii in the late game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27\u00a0<strong>Upgrades &amp; Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/extras/0ef41f32c85ad0ed0e9d89a7a1b98d17.avif?t=1759155778\" width=800 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your ship with new weapons and items to stand against increasingly powerful waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack &amp; Effects</strong><br>A driving, dark sci-fi soundtrack accompanies you through corrupted alien worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you become the light in the darkness \u2013 or will the void consume you?</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920990?t=1759155778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920990?t=1759155778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/84b8eedba89e1fba7c5dce6e96412da73b5db56b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759155778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/84b8eedba89e1fba7c5dce6e96412da73b5db56b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759155778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2921130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Astrum Vanguard:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astrum Vanguard</strong> is a fast-paced top-down shooter in retro pixel style where you fight against hostile alien species. Pilot your ship through dense enemy swarms, dodge deadly projectiles, and destroy bizarre boss enemies with an arsenal of futuristic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Intense Combat in Stylish Pixel Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920990/extras/14e89aa02034a138c0f54877f8a23779.avif?t=1759155778\" width=800 height=448 /></span><br>Battle enemies in hand-drawn pixel graphics inspired by classic arcade shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap